{save true}{false}ifelse}{false}ifelse
11 dict begin
/FontType 1 def
/FontMatrix [0.001 0 0 0.001 0 0 ]readonly def
/FontName /MOOIKC+CMMI10 def
/FontBBox {-32 -250 1048 750 }readonly def
/PaintType 0 def
